BANANA_NO_WARNINGS: no warning screen before the game. On the RG DS's Game & Watch they were "requires external
artwork" (without the user's artwork) and "ROM needs redump" (chips MAME hasn't verified, e.g. Zelda's melody):
nothing a player can act on, and the game runs. The warnings still go to the log.

diff --git a/src/frontend/mame/ui/ui.cpp b/src/frontend/mame/ui/ui.cpp
